WEBVTT

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:12.240
Yumi-san, is something wrong?

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:14.780
Oh, no, it's nothing.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:15.040
This way, Sachiko-sama.
Oh, no, it's nothing.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:16.140
This way, Sachiko-sama.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:20.610
S-Sachiko-sama?!

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:21.820
Cinderella
Yamayuri Lillian
Council Girls'
Version Academy

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:22.950
Cinderella
Yamayuri Lillian
Council Girls'
Version Academy
Yumi, this is for you.

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:23.880
Cinderella
Yamayuri Lillian
Council Girls'
Version Academy

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:27.760
"Lillian Girls' Academy,
Yamayuri Version Cinderella"...

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:31.720
I've marked it with a highlighter.

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:34.760
The pink is Cinderella. The blue is Step-Sister B.

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:36.360
Step-Sister B?

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:38.760
One of Cinderella's mean step-sisters.

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:43.770
If you do not play Cinderella,
we want you to play that role.

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:45.770
All right.

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:50.270
But why are you having lunch out here?

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:55.010
Yumi-san is avoiding the school
paper's attempts to interview her.

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:56.380
I see.

00:00:57.020 --> 00:01:00.510
Our school paper's methods for
covering stories are aggressive.

00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:05.620
Yumi, accept my rosary.

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:09.820
If you do, I shall take your place
and be interviewed instead.

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:10.920
What?

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:13.290
Feel free to let me know
whenever you decide to accept.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.470
Oh, Sachiko-sama!

00:01:18.940 --> 00:01:21.480
I was hoping to receive her
permission to display the photograph...

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:22.880
...at the school festival...

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:24.570
It cannot be helped.

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:27.840
Sachiko-sama dislikes both
cherry blossom and gingko trees.

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:28.880
I had no idea.

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:31.710
So I'm surprised.

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:32.480
What?

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:35.710
That she came all the way here to find you.

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:37.020
Cinderella
Yamayuri Lillian
Council Girls'
Version Academy

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:39.090
Sachiko
Ogasawara

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:42.160
Sachiko-sama...

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:50.840
The maidens, who flock to
Maria-sama's garden,

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:55.470
pass through the tall gates today yet
again with innocent, angelic smiles.

00:01:56.210 --> 00:02:00.270
Their pure hearts and bodies are
clad in deep-colored uniforms.

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:03.380
So that the pleats of their
skirts are not disturbed...

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:06.820
...and so that their white sailor
collars are not set aflutter,

00:02:06.820 --> 00:02:09.980
it is customary here to walk
slowly and with decorum.

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:15.460
The Private Lillian Girls' Academy,
a garden of maidens.

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:29.100
Maria Watches Over Us

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:51.930
The Moon and the Rosary

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:00.630
Um...

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:01.260
Hmm?

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:03.630
May I ask you a question?

00:04:04.070 --> 00:04:05.870
Nothing too difficult, now.

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:10.870
Why did you choose Shimako to be your soeur?

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:12.070
What?

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:17.050
It's not a difficult question, but it's unusual.

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:20.620
People normally don't ask why I chose Shimako.

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:26.820
That is... probably because she seems
like such an obvious choice.

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:30.390
The complete opposite of me.

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:32.400
You're awfully pessimistic.

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:35.360
I mean, I am "the straw."

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:36.470
What's that?

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:39.500
That was what you said, Rosa Gigantea!

00:04:39.640 --> 00:04:40.980
To Sachiko-sama,

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:43.670
I am "the straw" that she grabbed
upon a chance encounter.

00:04:44.780 --> 00:04:45.940
That's right, I did!

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:48.310
But that's a good metaphor,
if I do say so myself.

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:50.590
"The straw." That's great!

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:51.780
How is that great?!

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:55.160
The part where Sachiko keeps holding on.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.530
Don't you think talent the likes of Shimako's...

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:05.260
...should be utilized for the good
of the Yamayuri Council?

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:09.270
That's not your answer to
my earlier question, is it?

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:12.270
If I were to answer as Rosa Gigantea, it is.

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:16.240
I do have a separate, personal reason,

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:18.010
but that's a secret.

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:20.580
But to my thinking,

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:24.240
Shimako might be the one who envies you.

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:27.710
Please! How did the conversation
make the leap to that?!

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:30.480
That's because...

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:36.260
I wanted to see your cute funny faces.

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:36.920
Wai...

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:39.320
Rosa Gigantea!

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:43.500
"The millionaire" is here, so... the end.

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:44.830
"The millionaire"?

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:49.010
You seem to be really enjoying yourselves.

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:54.240
Oh, please, I did you a special favor
because I saw you coming in.

00:05:56.850 --> 00:05:57.680
Oh!

00:05:58.550 --> 00:06:01.110
Uh, um, I should wash the cups.

00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:04.420
Since everyone should be coming soon.

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:07.430
Yumi-chan, you're such a good girl.

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:13.930
I made Sachiko jealous for you.

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:18.810
Now, I guess I'll go check on things downstairs.

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:33.320
"I shall wear the red velvet dress."

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:39.760
"I-I'm fine with wearing my usual skirt."

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:43.060
"But to make up for it, I'll wear the
cape with the gold flower pattern..."

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:45.030
"...and the diamond broach."

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:48.430
"Onee-sama, what do you think
of doing your hair like this?"

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:53.270
"Cinderella, don't you wish
you could go to the ball, too?"

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:56.030
So you do have it all memorized!

00:06:57.650 --> 00:07:01.480
Even when Rosa Gigantea patted
me on the head and hugged me,

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:03.780
I never felt this self-conscious.

00:07:07.090 --> 00:07:09.990
Pardon us. We were off getting the costumes.

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:14.150
Oh? Were we actually interrupting something?

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:18.050
W-We were just rehearsing for the play.

00:07:19.130 --> 00:07:21.290
Aren't we getting fitted for our costumes?

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:22.330
Yes.

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:25.310
We have the costume fittings
and a dress rehearsal today,

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:27.240
so the Student Body President of
Hanadera will be coming as well.

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:30.070
We made sure to tell you, remember?

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:32.210
I expect you to participate too, Sachiko.

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:34.750
We should go receive him soon.

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:37.380
Yumi-chan, would you go?

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:41.350
Kashiwagi-san... Oh, that's the
Hanadera Student Body President.

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:43.250
He should be at the main gate.

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:44.880
All right.

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:50.460
No, no running.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:52.000
I might step on the gingko nuts.

00:07:56.440 --> 00:07:59.530
Um, pardon me, but are you Kashiwagi-san?

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:02.700
Are you a member of the Yamayuri Council?

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:04.480
I'm Kashiwagi Suguru.

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:07.110
I look forward to working with you today.

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:13.780
So you've already been accepted
by the Hanadera University?

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:15.660
I know they are affiliated, but even so,

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:19.090
only those with excellent grades are
admitted without testing, right?

00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:20.190
That is impressive.

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:24.060
Um, would you mind waiting here for a moment?

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:26.560
I shall return after
changing into my indoor shoes.

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:32.670
He's a completely flawless Prince,
but I guess Cinderella hates him.

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:36.770
Huh? Sachiko-sama?

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:39.310
Was it my imagination?

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:42.740
After all, Sachiko-sama
should be at the Rose Mansion.

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:45.980
Thank you very much for inviting me.

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:48.490
This mansion is splendid.

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:53.920
Sachiko-sama isn't here...

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:55.400
What do you think?

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:55.920
Huh?

00:08:56.630 --> 00:08:59.790
About the Hanadera Student Body
President. Objectively speaking.

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:01.130
What do I think?

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:04.260
Objectively speaking, I would
think he seems fairly exceptional.

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:07.200
A worthy partner for Sachiko, would you say?

00:09:07.340 --> 00:09:08.100
What?

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:11.410
There's a secret objective in doing this play.

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:14.640
To get Sachiko to overcome her dislike of men.

00:09:17.080 --> 00:09:19.380
Sachiko's family is complicated, you see.

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:23.510
Both her grandfather and father keep mistresses.

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:28.220
I suppose she has good reason to dislike men.

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:30.760
That reminds me, where is Cinderella?

00:09:31.230 --> 00:09:34.600
She left, saying she would be
waiting for us at the gymnasium.

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:40.370
Yumi-chan?

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:43.900
Uh, um, I will go on ahead as well.

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:47.340
So that was Sachiko-sama that I saw earlier?

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:48.950
Don't tell me she went home?

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:56.850
Sachiko-sama.

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:01.860
So, you didn't go home.

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:03.360
Why?

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:05.920
Earlier, on the path to the side of the library...

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:08.930
I wouldn't do that.

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:11.540
I see.

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:22.180
You'll soil your skirt.

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:25.420
Then, what about yourself?

00:10:25.650 --> 00:10:27.180
It's something I realized only now.

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:39.030
I was there.

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:39.860
What?

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:42.770
The truth is, I was there, at that place.

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:50.970
Maria Watches Over Us

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:56.010
I had thought to get a glimpse of him first.

00:10:56.750 --> 00:10:57.780
Was that all?

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:00.420
I just wanted to see him before he saw me.

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:01.520
That was all.

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:05.160
Listen to me.

00:11:05.590 --> 00:11:09.200
Certainly, I am unwilling to dance with
Hanadera's Student Body President,

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:10.130
but I lose if I run away.

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:13.700
And more than anything, I hate to lose!

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:18.770
I shall be your dance partner
until everyone arrives.

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:20.110
What? No, that's fine.

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:20.740
Oh, yes!
What? No, that's fine.

00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:23.870
You seem to have memorized the steps,

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:26.180
but you have yet to be able to dance smoothly.

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:27.580
Don't be nervous.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:29.750
That's easy for you to say, but...

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:31.050
You don't have to think.

00:11:31.050 --> 00:11:33.540
Have faith that your body remembers and let go.

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:35.550
Don't rush it. Smile.

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:38.750
One, two, three. One, two, three.

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:41.850
Right. You're starting to move wonderfully.

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:45.490
I had no idea dancing was so fun.

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:48.990
You're right! I had no idea, either!

00:11:58.080 --> 00:11:59.100
I am pleased to meet you.

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:01.350
My name is Ogasawara.

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:03.140
I look forward to working with you.

00:12:05.090 --> 00:12:06.820
I look forward to it as well.

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:10.550
Doesn't Kashiwagi-san look fantastic
dressed up as the Prince?

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:13.050
Now, you two go change as well.

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:14.490
Let us go, Yumi.

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:15.560
A-All right.

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:26.770
Are you ready?

00:12:27.270 --> 00:12:29.970
Don't you think the front
is a little too low-cut?

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:32.380
You have to give people at least a little service.

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:34.880
Just what kind of service are you talking about?

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:39.080
The sight of you at your most
beautiful to the Sachiko fans.

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:40.380
Right, Yumi-chan?

00:12:41.020 --> 00:12:42.790
It's good the way it is, don't you think?

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:43.980
Y-Yes.

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:45.280
Really?

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:46.220
Of course!

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:48.890
You might have to wear this, you know.

00:12:49.230 --> 00:12:50.890
You're right, that's a good point.

00:12:52.430 --> 00:12:54.400
It might be a little big for you, Yumi-chan.

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:56.000
Maybe we should take it in a bit...

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:56.660
Wait.

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:01.740
We have yet to determine who will
be playing Cinderella, after all.

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:03.380
Here, trade with me.

00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:06.850
Oh, Yumi-chan looks adorable, too!

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:08.610
D-Do you think so?

00:13:12.590 --> 00:13:16.650
As expected, I think the
front is too low-cut for me.

00:13:16.860 --> 00:13:20.020
One, two, three. Two, two, three.

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:23.460
One, two, three. Two, two, three.

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:26.620
One, two, three. Two, two, three.

00:13:26.900 --> 00:13:30.700
One, two, three. Two, two, three.

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.340
All right, we'll take a fifteen minute break.

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:40.250
Sachiko, I understand that
you find this unpleasant,

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:41.810
but why don't you smile a little more?

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:43.680
The audience will recoil if you perform like that.

00:13:44.450 --> 00:13:46.210
I'll smile properly during the real thing.

00:14:05.840 --> 00:14:09.070
Um, if there is anything I can do to help...

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:11.270
Then, accept the rosary.

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:12.010
What?

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:16.010
If there were to be anything I wanted
to ask of you, that would be all.

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:18.310
Do you find it that unpleasant?

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:19.220
I do.

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:22.310
Sacchan, I want to talk to you for a moment.

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:25.790
Yumi, go on back without me.

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:27.190
But...

00:14:27.360 --> 00:14:28.450
Just go!

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:29.490
All right.

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:36.400
Where's Sachiko?

00:14:36.800 --> 00:14:39.860
Um, she had something to
discuss with Kashiwagi-san.

00:14:39.970 --> 00:14:42.810
Without our two leads,
we won't be able to rehearse.

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:45.640
Well, let's wait a while.

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:50.520
They haven't come back.

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:53.090
Could they be planning to
just abandon the rehearsal?

00:14:53.090 --> 00:14:54.710
Sachiko is not the sort of girl to do that.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:55.480
You're right.

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:57.260
I'll go look.

00:14:57.260 --> 00:15:00.280
Um, I'll... I'll go.

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:02.190
Let's split up and look.

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:03.460
Understood?

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:15.700
Rosa Gigantea, this is no time to be...

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:17.670
Do you like Sachiko?

00:15:23.180 --> 00:15:24.080
Thank you.

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:26.410
I like Sachiko, too.

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:29.750
So does Rosa Chinensis, Rosa Foetida, and Rei,

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:31.890
and probably Shimako and Yoshino, too.

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:33.790
We may seem strong,

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:36.290
but we're still just high-school
students, so we're cowards.

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:39.160
We're afraid to find out what's happened.

00:15:39.400 --> 00:15:41.630
We feel that maybe we
shouldn't unmask whatever it is.

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:45.430
I have to go look for Sachiko-sama, too.

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:50.440
These gingko nuts are infuriating!

00:15:50.440 --> 00:15:50.810
Stop! Let go!
These gingko nuts are infuriating!

00:15:50.810 --> 00:15:51.810
Stop! Let go!

00:15:51.810 --> 00:15:52.740
Sachiko-sama!

00:15:53.410 --> 00:15:56.750
And I was so sure he would
never make a pass at Sachiko!

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:57.540
What?

00:15:57.890 --> 00:15:59.010
Birds of a feather can tell.

00:15:59.650 --> 00:16:00.680
What are you doing?!

00:16:01.320 --> 00:16:02.850
Take your hand off Sachiko!

00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:09.190
Sachiko, are you all right?

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:14.460
Yumi-chan, go call the security guard.

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:16.700
I can't go.

00:16:16.770 --> 00:16:17.430
What?

00:16:17.840 --> 00:16:19.770
Because it will leave Sachiko-sama in a bind.

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:21.510
Why do you think that?

00:16:22.140 --> 00:16:24.740
Because that's what is written on your face.

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:26.010
I see...

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:29.980
I'm sorry to trouble you.

00:16:30.450 --> 00:16:32.920
We merely got into a little argument.

00:16:33.390 --> 00:16:35.750
I would certainly like for
you to explain it to them.

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:38.650
He is...

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:42.760
Kashiwagi Suguru-san is my cousin.

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:50.300
Not only that, but he is also my betrothed.

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:52.260
B-Betro?!

00:16:52.340 --> 00:16:53.770
Therefore...

00:16:54.680 --> 00:16:56.270
Even if we are not putting on a performance,

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:57.930
we'll put our arms around each other...

00:16:58.750 --> 00:16:59.910
...and even kiss...

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:08.720
Would you please refrain
from getting carried away?!

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:12.360
Sacchan!

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:20.960
Who's there?

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:22.290
It's Yumi.

00:17:35.750 --> 00:17:38.340
It's no use, I don't know what to do.

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:41.080
There's nothing I can do for her.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:43.220
I should get everyone and...

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:46.060
Um, I...

00:17:47.090 --> 00:17:47.890
Stay.

00:17:49.730 --> 00:17:51.720
Stay here.

00:17:59.710 --> 00:18:00.900
Sachiko-sama...

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:06.370
Sachiko-sama, please give me the rosary.

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:07.880
No!

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:09.410
Why not?

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:10.640
I just won't.

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:13.650
I've changed my mind.

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:19.990
You see, Suguru-san does not
have any feelings for me.

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:22.650
But I am an only daughter...

00:18:23.230 --> 00:18:26.830
...and he is capable enough to
lead the Ogasawara Group.

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:29.770
Our parents want us to get married as well.

00:18:30.970 --> 00:18:34.000
So he says that he will marry me.

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:36.410
But, I...

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:39.940
You loved Kashiwagi-san, didn't you?

00:18:40.580 --> 00:18:44.520
To have someone you love say
he will marry you without love...

00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:47.450
That would be so painful.

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:51.990
Thank you for listening to me.

00:18:52.390 --> 00:18:54.090
It's the same as confession.

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:56.400
It was painful because I couldn't tell anyone.

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:57.800
So I'm fine now.

00:18:58.130 --> 00:19:01.190
But Sachiko-sama, please give me the rosary!

00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:04.330
Please let me fight.

00:19:05.270 --> 00:19:06.860
I don't want to run anymore.

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:09.440
Did you notice?

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:10.770
What?

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:14.610
Over half the plants in
this greenhouse are roses.

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:17.210
This is Rosa chinensis.

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:20.250
It's ever-flowering, you know.

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:22.780
Remember this flower.

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:26.260
Shall we return?

00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:27.720
Yes.

00:19:34.470 --> 00:19:36.130
"The guest has left."

00:19:36.470 --> 00:19:39.370
"Be sure to thoroughly wipe the soles
of your indoor shoes before entering."

00:19:39.870 --> 00:19:42.930
"Bringing in the odor of
gingko nuts is prohibited."

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:03.330
It's over now...

00:20:05.330 --> 00:20:08.270
I suppose I won't have occasion to
go to the Rose Mansion anymore.

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:11.760
Nor to converse with Sachiko-sama.

00:20:17.680 --> 00:20:19.010
I've been looking for you.

00:20:20.910 --> 00:20:23.040
Congratulations on a successful performance.

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:25.680
Your Cinderella was splendid, Sachiko-sama.

00:20:26.250 --> 00:20:27.310
Did you notice?

00:20:27.390 --> 00:20:27.940
What?

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:32.620
I stomped on Suguru-san's foot
three times during the dance.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:42.700
It's thanks to you that I can laugh about it now.

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:44.330
I didn't do anything...

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:46.360
Would you keep me company for a bit?

00:20:54.410 --> 00:20:56.310
Could I put this...

00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:58.180
...around your neck, Yumi?

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:03.320
No bets or sympathy or anything like that.

00:21:03.520 --> 00:21:05.920
This is a sacred ceremony, after all.

00:21:19.810 --> 00:21:22.070
I... accept.

00:21:23.480 --> 00:21:24.670
Thank you.

